"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"Dmitry Muratov, in an interview with the BBC, says that the Kremlin leader can only destroy Ukraine, not conquer it. The war has been going on for five years now.\",            \"english_title\": \"Muratov on Ukraine\",            \"translated_version\": \"Dmitry Muratov, en una entrevista con la BBC, dice que el l\u00edder del Kremlin solo puede destruir Ucrania, no conquistarla. La guerra ha estado pasando por cinco a\u00f1os.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Muratov sobre Ucrania\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"The UK government is taking action against shadow fleet vessels. They are doing this according to the law.\",            \"english_title\": \"UK Acts on Shadow Fleet\",            \"translated_version\": \"El gobierno del Reino Unido est\u00e1 tomando acci\u00f3n contra barcos de flota sombra. Est\u00e1n haciendo esto seg\u00fan la ley.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Reino Unido act\u00faa sobre flota sombra\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Two Palestinian families in the village of Qusra have been stuck in their homes since Sunday. They have no water or power.\",            \"english_title\": \"Families Stuck in Qusra\",            \"translated_version\": \"Dos familias palestinas en el pueblo de Qusra han estado atrapadas en sus casas desde el domingo. No tienen agua ni electricidad.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Familias atrapadas en Qusra\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"A disease outbreak declared on 15 May has caused over 2,000 deaths. There are thousands more reported cases.\",            \"english_title\": \"Disease Outbreak\",            \"translated_version\": \"Un brote de enfermedad declarado el 15 de mayo ha causado m\u00e1s de 2,000 muertes. Hay miles m\u00e1s de casos reportados.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Brote de enfermedad\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Grain exports from Russia and Ukraine are decreasing. Both countries are attacking each other's shipping facilities and ports.\",            \"english_title\": \"Grain Export Issues\",            \"translated_version\": \"Las exportaciones de grano de Rusia y Ucrania est\u00e1n disminuyendo. Ambos pa\u00edses est\u00e1n atacando las instalaciones de env\u00edo y puertos del otro.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Problemas de exportaci\u00f3n de grano\"        }    ]}"